1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,098
Everyone studies Warren Buffett and Charlie Munger,

2
00:00:03,098 --> 00:00:05,711
yet almost nobody remembers their brilliant

3
00:00:05,711 --> 00:00:07,169
third investing partner,

4
